  'Same-Quarter Harvested Area Change':'How harvested palay area changed compared with the same quarter one year earlier.',
  'Previous-Quarter Rainfall':'Total rainfall recorded for the quarter immediately before the target quarter.',
  'Previous-Quarter Mean Temperature':'Average temperature during the quarter immediately before the target quarter.',
  'Prior Historical Records':'The number of earlier province-and-ecosystem records available to provide historical context.',
  'Generated At':'The date and time ANI generated this model result.',
  'Retrospective Model Estimate':'A model-based reconstruction for a quarter that has already ended. It is not the official observed PSA yield.',
  'Forecasted Yield':'ANI’s model estimate of provincial palay yield for a future target quarter.',
  'Same Quarter Last Year':'The recorded yield from the same calendar quarter one year earlier.',
  'Difference from Median':'How far the ANI estimate is above or below the province’s same-quarter historical median.',
  'Typical Historical Range':'The middle half of earlier same-quarter yields, from the 25th to the 75th percentile.',
  'Province Same-Quarter Median':'The middle historical yield for this province, ecosystem, and the same calendar quarter.',
  'Recent 5-Year Same-Quarter Median':'The middle yield from the most recent five earlier occurrences of the same calendar quarter.',
  'Historical High-Yield Benchmark (75th Percentile)':'A historically high same-quarter yield reference. About 75% of earlier comparable yields were at or below this value. It is not an agronomic maximum or guaranteed farm target.',
  'Gap vs Historical High-Yield Benchmark':'How far the ANI estimate is above or below the historical 75th-percentile same-quarter benchmark.',
  'Long-Term Same-Quarter Trend':'The average historical direction of same-quarter yield over time, expressed as an approximate percent change per year.',
  'Trend Direction':'A plain-language summary of the long-term same-quarter yield trend: increasing, declining, broadly stable, or unavailable.',
  'Recent 3 vs Previous 3 Same-Quarter Median':'Compares the median of the three most recent comparable same-quarter yields with the three comparable observations immediately before them.',
  'Historical Position':'Shows whether the estimate is unusually low, below typical, within typical, above typical, or unusually high compared with earlier same-quarter yields.',
  'Seasonal Quarter Rank':'Ranks this calendar quarter against the other quarters using their historical median yields for the selected province and ecosystem.',
  'Matched Historical Observations':'The number of historical records where both palay yield and usable satellite vegetation data were available for the same province and quarter.',
  'Seasonally Adjusted NDVI–Yield Correlation':'The historical association between NDVI and yield after removing each quarter’s usual seasonal level. Positive values mean they tended to move in the same direction; correlation does not prove causation.',
  'NDVI Relationship':'A plain-language description of the seasonally adjusted NDVI–yield correlation strength and direction.',
  'Seasonally Adjusted EVI–Yield Correlation':'The historical association between EVI and yield after removing each quarter’s usual seasonal level. Positive values mean they tended to move in the same direction; correlation does not prove causation.',
  'EVI Relationship':'A plain-language description of the seasonally adjusted EVI–yield correlation strength and direction.',
  'Regional Same-Quarter Median':'The middle historical yield across provinces in the same region, ecosystem, and calendar quarter.',
  'Estimate vs Regional Median':'How far the ANI estimate is above or below the regional same-quarter median.',
  'Historical Percentile':'Shows where the estimate ranks among earlier same-quarter yields. A higher percentile means it is higher than more historical observations.',
  'Reference Period':'The earlier quarter used to describe conditions observed before the target quarter.',
  'Rainfall vs Seasonal Median':'How rainfall in the reference period compares with the typical rainfall for the same quarter in earlier years.',
  'Temperature vs Seasonal Median':'How temperature in the reference period compares with the typical temperature for the same quarter in earlier years.',
  'NDVI vs Seasonal Median':'How satellite-observed vegetation greenness compares with its typical value for the same season.',
  'Pre-Target Satellite Period':'The latest satellite observation period available before the quarter being estimated.',
  'Cropland NDVI':'NDVI is a satellite measure of vegetation greenness. Higher values generally mean greener, more active vegetation, but it is not a direct measure of crop health or yield.',
  'Cropland EVI':'EVI is another satellite vegetation measure that can better distinguish greenness in dense vegetation. It is supporting context, not a direct crop-health score.',
  'Vegetation Status':'A simple summary of whether satellite vegetation conditions are lower than, near, or higher than their usual seasonal level.',
  'NDVI Seasonal Median':'The middle NDVI value observed for the same season in earlier years.',
  'EVI Seasonal Median':'The middle EVI value observed for the same season in earlier years.',
